    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for all DSPy-compatible modules. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A module wraps a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_dspy_signature" kindref="compound">DspySignature</ref></computeroutput> and a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_dspy_l_l_m_provider" kindref="compound">IDspyLLMProvider</ref></computeroutput> and exposes a single <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_dspy_module_1a56e42fe6bab1c4b145bda5615bf9be50" kindref="member">forward()</ref></computeroutput> method that drives the full inference cycle:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Build the prompt.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Call the LLM provider.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Parse the response. </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
